### Deploy support-case-agent as code to Foundry. Run ./deploy.sh first, then send these.
### Docs: https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/foundry/agents/how-to/deploy-hosted-agent-code
### Endpoint is private - send from inside the VNet / in-VNet runner.

@endpoint = https://ai-knowledgebaseagent-v4k8-kmjn5t.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/proj-knowledgebaseagent-v4k8
@apiVersion = 2025-11-15-preview
@agent = support-case-agent
# zipSha256 + token come from .env, written by ./deploy.sh (token needs `az login`, lasts ~1h).
@zipSha256 = {{$dotenv zipSha256}}
@token = {{$dotenv token}}

### CREATE (first deploy). 409 already-exists -> use UPDATE below instead.
POST {{endpoint}}/agents?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
x-ms-agent-name: {{agent}}
x-ms-code-zip-sha256: {{zipSha256}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FoundryCodeDeploy

------FoundryCodeDeploy
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"
Content-Type: application/json

< ./metadata.json
------FoundryCodeDeploy
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="code"; filename="support-case-agent.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./agent.zip
------FoundryCodeDeploy--

### UPDATE (new version - agent already exists)
POST {{endpoint}}/agents/{{agent}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
x-ms-code-zip-sha256: {{zipSha256}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FoundryCodeDeploy

------FoundryCodeDeploy
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"
Content-Type: application/json

< ./metadata.json
------FoundryCodeDeploy
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="code"; filename="support-case-agent.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./agent.zip
------FoundryCodeDeploy--

### POLL a version until status = active
@version = 1
GET {{endpoint}}/agents/{{agent}}/versions/{{version}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### INVOKE (Responses protocol)
POST {{endpoint}}/agents/{{agent}}/endpoint/protocols/openai/responses?api-version=v1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-5.4",
  "input": "Hello! What can you do?",
  "stream": false
}

### DOWNLOAD the deployed zip (verify what's running)
GET {{endpoint}}/agents/{{agent}}/code:download?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
